  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection &amp; Restoration in the Rio Bravo Delta: Laguna Madre, Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will protect 4,607 acres on the Los Corrales Ranch; enhance 306 acres of freshwater wetlands adjacent to the Rio Grande Delta and the Laguna Madre; and restore 1.25 miles of the Arroyo del Tigre.</narrative>
  </description>
